OL,3,GNEWSAAnger at 'unreliable' buses after
OL,4,Adepot closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of a bus depot has caused a
OL,7,F"tenfold increase" in complaints about
OL,8,Fbus routes and reliability, a council
OL,9,Fleader said.
OL,11,FRedcar and Cleveland Council Labour
OL,12,Fleader Alec Brown said the closure of
OL,13,FArriva's depot in Dormanstown has seen
OL,14,Fstaff move to a different base in
OL,15,FStockton.
OL,17,FHe said in the last two weeks
OL,18,F"cancellations have gone through the
OL,19,Froof" and he has been told the bus
OL,20,Fcompany is having to bring get
OL,21,Femergency staff in.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
